{"ts":"2026-10-10T11:35:03.446Z","type":"agent_event","event":{"type":"content_end","contentType":"reasoning","reasoning":"Now I need to update AdminApp to support passcode authentication: adding a passcodeRequired prop, reading the stored passcode, attaching it as a header on requests, showing a passcode entry box and banner, triggering a refresh when the passcode is set, and handling 401 responses appropriately.\n\nI'm thinking refresh should take the passcode explicitly rather than relying on effect-triggered state updates, to avoid lint issues with setState inside effects. On a 401, I'll show a \"Wrong passcode\" message and clear the stored value. The passcode box should appear when protection is required but no passcode is stored yet, with a \"Locked 🔒 · Change passcode\" button once one is set, and I'll show a demo-mode banner when passcodeRequired is false. I've decided to hide the rest of the admin UI and just show the passcode box when locked, which is simpler than trying to partially render things.\n\n"}}
